        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A^4]</span> given that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Find [MATH: A^4] given that [MATH: [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, to find <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A^2,]</span> we multiply <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A]</span> by itself:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: A^{2}|= A \u22c5 A; = [3|0; 5|\u2212 1] \u22c5 [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]; = [9|0; 10|1]]</span></p><p>Now, since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A^4 = A^2 \\cdot A^2,]</span> we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: A^{4}|= A^{2} \u22c5 A^{2}; = [9|0; 10|1] \u22c5 [9|0; 10|1]; = [81|0; 100|1].]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, to find [MATH: A^2,] we multiply [MATH: A] by itself:\n\n[MATH: A^{2}|= A \u22c5 A; = [3|0; 5|\u2212 1] \u22c5 [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]; = [9|0; 10|1]]\n\nNow, since [MATH: A^4 = A^2 \\cdot A^2,] we get\n\n[MATH: A^{4}|= A^{2} \u22c5 A^{2}; = [9|0; 10|1] \u22c5 [9|0; 10|1]; = [81|0; 100|1].]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind [MATH: A^4] given that [MATH: [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, to find [MATH: A^2,] we multiply [MATH: A] by itself:\n\n[MATH: A^{2}|= A \u22c5 A; = [3|0; 5|\u2212 1] \u22c5 [3|0; 5|\u2212 1]; = [9|0; 10|1]]\n\nNow, since [MATH: A^4 = A^2 \\cdot A^2,] we get\n\n[MATH: A^{4}|= A^{2} \u22c5 A^{2}; = [9|0; 10|1] \u22c5 [9|0; 10|1]; = [81|0; 100|1].]"
      },
